    add("Pinned base main: `912bc7010058092ea735dcda0aa941429194474b`. Warehouse: `97a8bb566826afe5a3e5a7b8c632043d8a1dca24`. Final simulator execution pin: `ca41c79426a90a57e78ca9554a993db326461737`. Exact executed file hashes are in `results/run_receipt.json`; subsequent WS4 bridge/report changes do not alter those engine draws. `results/upstream_and_boundary_verification.json` proves imported WS1/WS2/WS4 trees are byte-identical to their pins and `.github`, `.training-control`, `config` and `scripts` match base main.\n")
