    add("Rebound opportunities derive from field-goal misses and an explicitly approximate terminal-FT fraction; a residual unattributed/dead-ball category remains. Offensive and defensive credited counts allocate without exceeding available opportunities. Each assist is tied to a scorer's made field goal and allocated to another eligible teammate; unassisted makes remain explicit. Event-time lineups and quarter-by-quarter scoring are not modeled. Steals, blocks and turnovers are extensible but disabled for forecasting until validated.\n")
